 or equally near with a lower number.", "why": "These are the nearest rule and the tie rule from the statement.", "lines": "5-8"}, {"subgoal": "Test: requests \\(\\{2, 6\\}\\), current 4", "action": "Station 2: distance 2; take it.", "why": "`best` is still -1.", "lines": "3-8", "state": [{"label": "best", "value": "2"}]}, {"subgoal": "Test: requests \\(\\{2, 6\\}\\), current 4", "action": "Station 6: distance 2; keep 2.", "why": "The distances tie and 6 is not lower than 2.", "lines": "3-8", "state": [{"label": "best", "value": "2"}]}, {"subgoal": "Test: requests \\(\\{2, 6\\}\\), current 4", "action": "Return 2.", "why": "Both stations are 2 away, and the lower number wins.", "lines": "10", "state": [{"label": "best", "value": "2"}]}]}]}
